{"seq":17,"slug":"b2b-ecommerce","title":"B2B 电商","stage":"DONE","category":"ecommerce","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/ecommerce/b2b-ecommerce","rating":{"composite":3.57,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.25,"positioning":3,"strategic":3.33},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.49,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":3.25}},"introMarkdown":"# B2B 电商 简介\n\nB2B（Business-to-Business）电商是指企业与企业之间通过互联网平台完成商品或服务交易的商业模式。与面向消费者的 B2C 电商不同，B2B 电商的交易金额更大、决策链更长、客户关系更为复杂，往往涉及询报价、合同签订、大宗物流、供应链金融等多个环节。\n\n全球 B2B 电商市场规模远超 B2C。以中国为例，阿里巴巴 1688、找钢网、震坤行等平台在各自垂直领域构建了高效的线上交易网络；在全球范围内，Amazon Business、Shopify Plus、SAP Ariba 等也在加速企业采购的数字化转型。无论是平台型撮合还是自营交易，B2B 电商正在深刻改变传统产业的流通效率与协作方式。\n\n本知识库从四个维度系统梳理 B2B 电商的核心知识体系：\n\n**第一章 B2B 电商模式**聚焦商业模式与市场格局，比较平台型与自营型的运营差异，分析垂直行业的 B2B 实践，并深入探讨 B2B 与 B2C 在产品、运营、技术层面的本质区别。\n\n**第二章 交易与供应链**围绕 B2B 核心交易流程展开，包括询报价体系的设计、大宗商品交易的特殊逻辑、供应链金融的数字化方案，以及针对企业物流的履约体系。\n\n**第三章 技术平台建设**面向 B2B 电商的技术架构，涵盖商品信息管理（PIM）、客户分层与 CRM 系统、企业采购门户搭建，以及系统间 API 集成与生态接入的最佳实践。\n\n**第四章 增长与运营**关注 B2B 电商的业务增长策略，包括企业获客渠道与方法论、客户成功体系的构建、数据驱动的动态定价机制，以及 B2B 跨境与国际化拓展。\n\n推荐学习路径：如果你是 B2B 电商的初学者，建议从第一章入手，建立对商业模式与市场格局的整体认知；具备基础认知后，可深入第二章理解核心业务流程；技术从业者可重点关注第三章的系统架构设计；而负责业务增长的读者则适合从第四章获取运营策略参考。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"b2b-models","title":"B2B 电商模式","docCount":3,"url":"/h/ecommerce/b2b-ecommerce/b2b-models","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"platform-vs-self-operated","title":"平台型与自营型 B2B 电商模式比较","url":"/h/ecommerce/b2b-ecommerce/b2b-models/platform-vs-self-operated"},{"seq":2,"slug":"vertical-industry-practices","title":"垂直行业 B2B 电商实践","url":"/h/ecommerce/b2b-ecommerce/b2b-models/vertical-industry-practices"},{"seq":3,"slug":"b2b-vs-b2c-differences","title":"B2B 与 B2C 电商差异深度分析","url":"/h/ecommerce/b2b-ecommerce/b2b-models/b2b-vs-b2c-differences"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"transaction-supply-chain","title":"交易与供应链","docCount":3,"url":"/h/ecommerce/b2b-ecommerce/transaction-supply-chain","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rfq-system-design","title":"B2B 询报价系统设计","url":"/h/ecommerce/b2b-ecommerce/transaction-supply-chain/rfq-system-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"bulk-commodity-trading","title":"大宗商品交易流程与平台设计","url":"/h/ecommerce/b2b-ecommerce/transaction-supply-chain/bulk-commodity-trading"},{"seq":3,"slug":"supply-chain-finance","title":"供应链金融数字化","url":"/h/ecommerce/b2b-ecommerce/transaction-supply-chain/supply-chain-finance"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"technology-platform","title":"技术平台建设","docCount":3,"url":"/h/ecommerce/b2b-ecommerce/technology-platform","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"product-information-management","title":"B2B 商品信息管理（PIM）系统","url":"/h/ecommerce/b2b-ecommerce/technology-platform/product-information-management"},{"seq":2,"slug":"customer-segmentation-crm","title":"B2B 客户分层与 CRM 系统设计","url":"/h/ecommerce/b2b-ecommerce/technology-platform/customer-segmentation-crm"},{"seq":3,"slug":"procurement-portal-api-integration","title":"企业采购门户与 API 集成","url":"/h/ecommerce/b2b-ecommerce/technology-platform/procurement-portal-api-integration"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"growth-operations","title":"增长与运营","docCount":3,"url":"/h/ecommerce/b2b-ecommerce/growth-operations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"customer-acquisition-strategies","title":"B2B 电商获客策略与渠道","url":"/h/ecommerce/b2b-ecommerce/growth-operations/customer-acquisition-strategies"},{"seq":2,"slug":"customer-success-system","title":"B2B 客户成功体系","url":"/h/ecommerce/b2b-ecommerce/growth-operations/customer-success-system"},{"seq":3,"slug":"data-driven-pricing-internationalization","title":"数据驱动定价与国际化 B2B","url":"/h/ecommerce/b2b-ecommerce/growth-operations/data-driven-pricing-internationalization"}]}]}